<!-- HOME SECTION — The Experience (home page only).
     Job of this section: DEMONSTRATE the whole interview engine in one watchable walkthrough: how an
     interview is set up, how the person is questioned, how every answer is scored, what the report
     contains and how progress is tracked. The hero's "See Demo" button lands here (#demo).
     Left: five chapters. They double as the video's chapter buttons. The active chapter turns into a
     light card in its own highlighter colour, and its key points are highlighted in step with the
     narration. Right: the video player (captions, transcript, clickable end-of-video "Try MedhaIQ now").
     The video is a recorded walkthrough of the real home, setup, interview, report and workspace screens
     with fictional sample data and AI-generated narration. No autoplay, and no sound until play.
     Player controls reuse the .mh-scr-* player rules in home-motion.css (no new CSS file).
     Assets: /assets/interview-demo/interview-walkthrough.mp4, -poster.jpg and .vtt (captions). -->
<style>
